   "locked": false,
   "text": "src/core/element-store.ts · src/core/board-seed.ts · src/core/board-state.ts\none Map per workspace, created on first use, and watched so every change is saved.\nAn unknown id yields an empty store, never another board's.\nRead from the last save, or the board file; written back beside the registry.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "src/core/element-store.ts · src/core/board-seed.ts · src/core/board-state.ts\none Map per workspace, created on first use, and watched so every change is saved.\nAn unknown id yields an empty store, never another board's.\nRead from the last save, or the board file; written back beside the registry.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
