   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1785079211380,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Stream the issue agent into\nthe terminal too.\n\n#149 put the implement agent\nin a tab of its own, opened in\nits worktree while the run is\nalive. The issue agent has the\nsame gap and none of the work\nleft: runAgent takes a host,\nand runIssueAgent passes none.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Stream the issue agent into\nthe terminal too.\n\n#149 put the implement agent\nin a tab of its own, opened in\nits worktree while the run is\nalive. The issue agent has the\nsame gap and none of the work\nleft: runAgent takes a host,\nand runIssueAgent passes none.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
