   "locked": false,
   "text": "customData.kind = \"project-board\"\n\nThe GitHub project, leftmost on\nthe canvas and never saved: it\nis redrawn from GitHub on every\nread. Alt+B jumps to it. Todo\nreads oldest first, and ↻ on its\nheader is a per-board queue that\nfills each slot as it frees.\nAn empty mirror says why, once.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "customData.kind = \"project-board\"\n\nThe GitHub project, leftmost on\nthe canvas and never saved: it\nis redrawn from GitHub on every\nread. Alt+B jumps to it. Todo\nreads oldest first, and ↻ on its\nheader is a per-board queue that\nfills each slot as it frees.\nAn empty mirror says why, once.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
