   "text": "customData.kind = \"terminal\"\n\nShells between the mirror and\nthe documentation, as tabs;\neight a board. A run opens one\nin its worktree. Derived: a\nblock lives as long as its tabs.\nClick the screen to type; the\nheader drags it. + / x open,\nclose; ⧉ detaches right and the\ndocumentation steps aside; ⇤\njoins. Alt+T returns; -/+ font.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "customData.kind = \"terminal\"\n\nShells between the mirror and\nthe documentation, as tabs;\neight a board. A run opens one\nin its worktree. Derived: a\nblock lives as long as its tabs.\nClick the screen to type; the\nheader drags it. + / x open,\nclose; ⧉ detaches right and the\ndocumentation steps aside; ⇤\njoins. Alt+T returns; -/+ font.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
