   "text": "customData.kind = \"board-section\"\n\nThe mark a hotkey aims at.\nThe shape carries the title and\nthe key, so the board declares\nits own navigation.\nIts key, and Alt+B and Alt+T,\nreach the board even while the\nterminal has the keyboard; the\nshell is not sent them.",
