   "locked": false,
   "text": "docs/development-log.md\n\nOne dated entry per merged pull request: the issue, the\npull request, and what was decided. delivered.md and\nopen-work.md folded in here — both had stopped being\ntrue, and a log that is only appended to cannot.\n\nWritten before the merge, so it runs one entry ahead of\ngit log. scripts/check-board-map.mjs fails the other way.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "docs/development-log.md\n\nOne dated entry per merged pull request: the issue, the\npull request, and what was decided. delivered.md and\nopen-work.md folded in here — both had stopped being\ntrue, and a log that is only appended to cannot.\n\nWritten before the merge, so it runs one entry ahead of\ngit log. scripts/check-board-map.mjs fails the other way.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
