   "updated": 1785079211379,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "src/core/implement-worktree.ts · implement-queue.ts · implement-state.ts\nimplement-recovery.ts · implement-agent.ts · implement-landing.ts\nAn issue becomes a run in a git worktree of its own,\n<project>-worktrees/issue-<n>, on a branch of the same name.\nFour at once; a slot takes the oldest card whose declared\ndependencies have closed. An interrupted run is offered for resume.\ngithub-pull.ts reads back what became of the pull request: done\nmeans it merged; blocked means the agent stopped for a person.\nA run that ends without one is finished by a second agent, once.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "src/core/implement-worktree.ts · implement-queue.ts · implement-state.ts\nimplement-recovery.ts · implement-agent.ts · implement-landing.ts\nAn issue becomes a run in a git worktree of its own,\n<project>-worktrees/issue-<n>, on a branch of the same name.\nFour at once; a slot takes the oldest card whose declared\ndependencies have closed. An interrupted run is offered for resume.\ngithub-pull.ts reads back what became of the pull request: done\nmeans it merged; blocked means the agent stopped for a person.\nA run that ends without one is finished by a second agent, once.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
