   "text": "docs/running.md\n\nnpm run build, then node dist/server.js\non PORT=3737. Kill what is listening\nfirst. Every EXCALIDRAW_* variable is\noptional and github.com is required.\n\nIts tables are generated from\nsrc/core/settings.ts.",
